# phase-D roots (PROTOCOL.md section 14.6's four disjoint namespaces)
/results_probe_d/
/results_gate_d/
/results_pilot_d/
/results_factorial/
# D3 control (PROTOCOL.md section 19.7): a fifth root, disjoint from the four
# above -- a control is not a gate, its resume sentinels must not be
# adoptable by one. D3's own non-gating section 19.3 diagnostic writes to a
# sixth, separate root.
/results_d3_oscillator/
/results_d3_diagnostic/
# PROTOCOL.md section 23's three NEW self-sufficient roots, plus the 23.3 rate
# sweep that feeds them and the 21.3 re-run root -- 140 runs x one ckpt.pt.
/results_sweep_osc/
/results_ssm_delta/
/results_osc_n/
/results_osc_delta/
/results_gate_d2/
/results_osc_hfr/
/results_osc_decomp/
/results_primary_factorial/
# PROTOCOL.md section 28's basis root (declared 2026-08-15, started 2026-08-18).
/results_basis/
/results_smoke/
# Comptabilite d'execution, pas des sources : marqueurs de reprise et journaux
# de shards. Le contenu scientifique vit dans les racines results_* (ignorees)
# et dans PROTOCOL.md / _private/AGENT_JOURNAL.md (versionne / prive).
/.runstate/
/logs/
*.npz

